      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "1419-1443",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不请自来的报告是一种从人群中脱颖而出的出色方式。",
      "totalCount": 660
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 348724053,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_8_722-802",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "722-802",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "是的，你可能每天熬夜到凌晨，但你永远不会承认这一点，永远不会让人知道，永远不会抱怨你的工作有多辛苦或你投入多少时间。在外人看来，你漫不经心、轻松自在、泰然自若。",
      "totalCount": 600
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 243646038,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_12_1439-1486",
      "chapterUid": 12,
      "range": "1439-1486",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如果你没有规划，就很容易坚持不下去，最后就会像在生活的漩涡中漂流的浮萍一样，漂到哪里就是哪里。",
      "totalCount": 522
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 546501914,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_8_1105-1157",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "1105-1157",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "永远不要求助：永远不要承认某事超出你的能力范围——你可以请求得到指导、建议、信息和意见，但永远不要求助。",
      "totalCount": 493
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 358356550,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_9_906-923",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "906-923",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我会始终努力把用完的东西放回原处。",
      "totalCount": 442
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 918906305,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_8_1349-1385",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "1349-1385",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "始终寻找能减轻工作量的方法——在不知不觉之中——以及加快工作进度的方法。",
      "totalCount": 374
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 256235359,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_107_1709-1727",
      "chapterUid": 107,
      "range": "1709-1727",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "重要的是你怎么想，而不是他们怎么想。",
      "totalCount": 374
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 321557560,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_119_2124-2135",
      "chapterUid": 119,
      "range": "2124-2135",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "谨慎许诺，提供超值服务",
      "totalCount": 348
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 910278604,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_9_1311-1330",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "1311-1330",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我们必须努力在任何时候都做到尽善尽美。",
      "totalCount": 330
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 75207454,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_14_1225-1263",
      "chapterUid": 14,
      "range": "1225-1263",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你必须学会不再担忧，放松下来，别把它看得那么严重，多享受一下，客观看待事物。",
      "totalCount": 325
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 910278604,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_7_666-690",
      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "666-690",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不请自来的报告是一种从人群中脱颖而出的出色方式。",
      "totalCount": 324
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 422158443,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_7_504-534",
      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "504-534",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你必须要出名，这样你才能脱颖而出，你的升职潜力才能得以展现。",
      "totalCount": 300
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 32506069,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_11_1605-1619",
      "chapterUid": 11,
      "range": "1605-1619",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "永远不要延迟兑现或兑现不足。",
      "totalCount": 288
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 358356550,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_9_950-1010",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "950-1010",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我将自由、公开地把任何技能、知识或经验传递给任何可以使用它们的人，使他们在同行业中受益——我不会为了拥有信息而独占信息。",
      "totalCount": 285
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 910278604,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_15_1348-1373",
      "chapterUid": 15,
      "range": "1348-1373",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "聪明人会专心走自己的路，不去管别人选择了什么路线。",
      "totalCount": 285
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 429224732,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_13_1271-1294",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "1271-1294",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "这条法则有一个非常简单的内容：不要传任何闲话。",
      "totalCount": 272
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 910278604,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_29_851-903",
      "chapterUid": 29,
      "range": "851-903",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "因此，本条法则很简单，就是不要说教、宣传、试图改变别人的信仰，不要公开宣布你在做的事情，甚至提都不要提。",
      "totalCount": 272
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 14887629,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_30_724-754",
      "chapterUid": 30,
      "range": "724-754",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "智慧不是指不犯错误，而是指学会在事后带着尊严和理智全身而退。",
      "totalCount": 255
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 25295794,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_16_1509-1525",
      "chapterUid": 16,
      "range": "1509-1525",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你要严肃、成熟、有成年人的样子。",
      "totalCount": 252
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300103467",
      "userVid": 28508106,
      "bookmarkId": "3300103467_26_1106-1131",
      "chapterUid": 26,
      "range": "1106-1131",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "得有一条线，你不能超越它。你得知道那条线画在哪里。",
      "totalCount": 252
    }
  ],
